msgid "Markdown (MyST)"
msgstr "Markdown (MyST)"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:105
#: ef2a90f39ead47f88b19ecf2c5e04557
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use MyST-flavored Markdown. **Never nest `` ``` `` fences inside `` "
"```{admonition} ``** — that breaks zh_CN rendering. Use colon fences "
"(`:::`) when an admonition must contain a code block, and wrap examples "
"of fences in a 4-backtick outer fence:"
msgstr ""
"使用 MyST 风格的 Markdown。**切勿在 `` ```{admonition} `` 内部嵌套 `` ``` `` 围栏**——这会破坏 zh_CN 渲染。当提示框需要包含代码块时，请使用冒号围栏（`:::`）；展示围栏语法的示例请用 4 个反引号作为外层围栏："

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:107
#: beacbe7a948d4e98af8974a3e173098e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# Heading\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph text.\n"
"\n"
"## Subheading\n"
"\n"
"- List item\n"
"- Another item\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"code block\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
":::{admonition} Note\n"
":class: tip\n"
"\n"
"Admonition content.\n"
":::\n"
msgstr ""
"# Heading\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph text.\n"
"\n"
"## Subheading\n"
"\n"
"- List item\n"
"- Another item\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"code block\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
":::{admonition} Note\n"
":class: tip\n"
"\n"
"Admonition content.\n"
":::\n"

